    "synopsis": {
        "native": "Pour les vacances, Gabriel et Iris retournent dans une maison de famille au Portugal avec leurs filles Emma et Zo\u00e9, d\u2019irr\u00e9sistibles jumelles de 6 ans. Au coeur d\u2019un paysage solaire, des baignades et des rires des petites, le pass\u00e9 du couple se r\u00e9veille. Emma est d\u00e9pass\u00e9e par un secret trop grand pour elle, qu\u2019elle n\u2019a pas le droit de partager avec sa jumelle.",
        "english": "For their summer vacation, Iris and Gabriel return to their family house in Portugal with their adorable six-year-old twins, Emma and Zo\u00e9. In this sun-drenched landscape, between swims in the river and their children's laughter, the couple's past begins to rear its head. Emma is overwhelmed by a secret that is too big for her to carry, a secret that she is not allowed to share with her sister."
